        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "          50          Gethsamani Pikwan khou",
            "                      15.15.15. 15. Ref. 5.5. 10. 10. 10.5",
            "          Doh hei D",
            "",
            "          1. Gethsamani pikwan khou Jisu rui huayneypui ganv khou,",
            "             Zauczihmei rihmei guay rui guang lana kata nym kan the.",
            "             Baanh khou riang rui bangclouna Jisu ta zayna tat kan the.",
            "",
            "                  O, ryanraa dyng e! (2)",
            "                  Kakhuay khat sihnic maekmei Jisu tei! (2)",
            "                  Saa ngam makmei ram ryanraa akhaengvna,",
            "                  Cross khou theiclou the!",
            "",
            "          2. Poubauhmei ta siina rairiu lana cross khou swluai the.",
            "             He \"daic liangmei Jihudimei Guangc le,\" twna saa bam e.",
            "             Kaphay Kabaanc kaguay ntanh sauc rui hianna swluai the.",
            "",
            "          3. Poubauhmei tuang ryanraa ryanriumei tei aniw khangrui e.",
            "             Aniw Kata tingmik kathuih amuclou ngam nina cho?",
            "             Ryanraa ryanriu khaegvmei kaguayna hei aniw khangrui e.",
            "",
            "          4. Poubauhmei rui ryanraa langvpui zaengrui",
            "                                            kros ruc khou kaucna,",
            "             Meic kaguayna rui lungning ryanraana kap nic kaplou the.",
            "             Kata swluaimei nunc tei neihlaamei rui saa ngammak khe."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
